          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwadukuta shamooghooda maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, ak ghwanyiit giigheambiita NG'UTAMIIDA maheemajeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Musa ea mudughoamu gawa jeeda maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, aba gideaba gwanda badaydida shamooghooda, ak ghwanyiit giigheambiita NG'UTAMIIDA maheemajeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea geetiing'da shamooghooda ghabeawa heeda maheemajeanda hean gwasaw fuga Israeli gaweay bareanyeeka nyaawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea iimeetiing'da shamooghooda, ea maygaweay bareanyeeka ea eaghus gwadiyeada gicha shamooghooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba shamooghoodida bea NG'UTAMIIDEAN, goobiita badayda maheemajeanda askweari; ak eawa gwanda jeadaanyi beasta, aba madeeda fuga Israeli sean aba bareanyeeka nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
